      "summary": "Dataset validation, validation depth with adequacy warnings, and stateful predictive rollout",
      "responsibilities": [
        "Check the dataset files, contract fields and time coverage behind a validation and report them as a compact depth summary Group continuous failed series points by worst block into compact intervals; keep per-point details in full JSON and enforce only requested additional adequacy floors. Emit ordinary result dictionaries without re-validating generated output schemas. Batch fitting and series checks skip unit hints they do not expose. Apply parameter-stratum checks only when the policy declares strata; preserve count, gap and native-contribution guards.",
